-- DIM v1 - DIMENSIONALITY building plugin  (marker: DIM_V1)
-- Command Bar, EDIT mode. Makes ServerStorage.DIMPlugin (a Script) and selects it.
-- THEN: right-click DIMPlugin in Explorer -> "Save as Local Plugin..." -> Save.
--   A "DIM" toolbar appears in the Plugins tab. Click DIM to open the panel.
-- HOTKEYS: File -> Customize Shortcuts -> search "DIM" -> give keys to the ones you want
--   (DIM On/Off, Hide Planes, Front/Top/Right/Iso/Normal To, Extrude, Rect, Circle, Polygon, Line ...)
-- HOW IT WORKS:
--   1 click a part            -> its Front / Top / Right planes appear through its centre
--   2 click a plane           -> sketch on that plane (camera turns to face it)
--     or click a FACE of it   -> sketch on that face
--   3 draw: Rect / Circle / Polygon / Line. Snaps to corners, centres, midpoints, the origin,
--     and lines up with them (grey dashed guide). Shift = 1/10 grid, Ctrl = no snap.
--   4 type exact sizes in the SHAPE box, then EXTRUDE (depth, Out / In / Both)
--   Mirror / Pattern work on the selection (Ctrl-click parts to add them; the clicked part is the centre)
--   Face mode = click a face and push / pull it by an exact amount.
--   Ctrl+Z undoes extrude / mirror / pattern / face moves. Esc cancels / leaves the sketch.

local RS = game:GetService("RunService")
if not RS:IsEdit() then warn("NOT INSTALLED - you are in Play. Stop Play and run again in Edit.") return end
local SS = game:GetService("ServerStorage")

local old = SS:FindFirstChild("DIMPlugin")
if old then old:Destroy() end
